* Connection\nmultiplexing
** The socket
*** ControlMaster offers it
*** ControlPath names it
*** ControlPersist outlives\nthe first session
*** expanded per destination
** Built on channels
*** MUX_LISTENER
*** MUX_CLIENT
*** MUX_PROXY
*** ctl_chan binds session\nto its client
** Message set
*** MUX_MSG_HELLO,\nversion 4
*** NEW_SESSION,\nNEW_STDIO_FWD
*** OPEN_FWD / CLOSE_FWD\nLOCAL, REMOTE, DYNAMIC
*** ALIVE_CHECK, TERMINATE,\nSTOP_LISTENING
** Passenger mode
*** passes stdio descriptors
*** master relays bytes
*** client stays trivial
*** must share a host
** Proxy mode
*** MUX_C_PROXY switches\nthe socket language
*** client speaks SSH\nconnection protocol
*** no descriptor passing
*** may be relayed to\nanother host
@endmindmap
